 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 666583,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is returned by <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">calc_sqft()</code>?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">def calc_sqft(length, width):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;sqft = length * width\n&nbsp;&nbsp;return\n</pre>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328790,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">sqft</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The function should return sqft but is missing the variable name in the return statement."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328791,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">None</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">return</code> is a valid statement to end the function and return to the calling code without a specified value. <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">calc_sqft()</code> should return <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">sqft</code> with the line <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">return sqft</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328792,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Error</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">return</code> is a valid statement to end the function. When a return value isn't specified, Python functions return None."
    }
   ],
